From: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Local: media: cedrus: add multi-planar encoder input

Expose NV12 and NV12M through one multi-planar encoder device.
Program separate luma and chroma addresses for NV12M buffers.
Apply V4L2 data offsets to every hardware buffer address.

Signed-off-by: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
---
--- a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus_enc.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus_enc.c
